- `hypotheses/hypotheses_draft.json` — initial three hypotheses (H1–H3) with full fields.
- `hypotheses/hypotheses.json` — final retained hypotheses (H2, H3) with narrowing notes.
- `hypotheses/hypothesis_brief.md` — human-readable summary with evidence details.

